<title>USA: Regis, Supercuts to vote on merger.</title>
<headline>Regis, Supercuts to vote on merger.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regis Corp and Supercuts Inc said Wednesday they have set October 23 as the date for special shareholder meetings to vote on the merger of the two companies.</p>
<p>The companies said a joint proxy statement has been sent to Regis shareholders of record on September 19 and Supercuts shareholders of record on September 24.</p>
<p>Regis and Supercuts agreed to merge in July in a stock-for-stock transaction.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
